{
  "name": "all-gated-out",
  "domain": "algo-model",
  "format": "experiment-record",
  "description": "四条实验记录都有指标（P0 确实枚举出 4 个候选），但每一个都被 P1 的某个谓词排除：cancelled 的实验（deleted）、只有权重产物的指标（extension，.bin 不是可评审文本）、pack 自己声明的 **/legacy/** 下的旧记录（user-exclude）、vendor 目录下的第三方基线（default-path）。全部排除理由都由 pack 自己的 gate 产生，fixture 不带任何 gate 块。",
  "input": {
    "format": "experiment-record",
    "payload": {
      "experiments": [
        {
          "id": "vision/cancelled-run",
          "name": "cancelled sweep",
          "seed": 1,
          "dataset": {
            "train": 1000,
            "valid": 100,
            "test": 100,
            "splitsHash": "sha256:eee"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "name": "accuracy",
              "value": 0.5,
              "definition": "top-1 accuracy on the test split"
            }
          ],
          "budget": {
            "steps": 0,
            "gpuHours": 0
          },
          "status": "cancelled"
        },
        {
          "id": "vision/weights-only",
          "name": "checkpoint export",
          "seed": 2,
          "dataset": {
            "train": 1000,
            "valid": 100,
            "test": 100,
            "splitsHash": "sha256:fff"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "name": "weights",
              "value": "sha256:deadbeef",
              "kind": "artifact"
            }
          ],
          "budget": {
            "steps": 10,
            "gpuHours": 0.1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "legacy/model-v1",
          "name": "legacy run",
          "seed": 3,
          "dataset": {
            "train": 1000,
            "valid": 100,
            "test": 100,
            "splitsHash": "sha256:ggg"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "name": "accuracy",
              "value": 0.6,
              "definition": "top-1 accuracy on the test split"
            }
          ],
          "budget": {
            "steps": 100,
            "gpuHours": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "vendor/long-report",
          "name": "per class report",
          "seed": 4,
          "dataset": {
            "train": 1000,
            "valid": 100,
            "test": 100,
            "splitsHash": "sha256:hhh"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "name": "per_class_report",
              "value": "{\"class-0001\": 0.912, \"class-0002\": 0.881, \"class-0003\": 0.923, \"class-0004\": 0.870, \"class-0005\": 0.901, \"class-0006\": 0.915, \"class-0007\": 0.889, \"class-0008\": 0.933, \"class-0009\": 0.877, \"class-0010\": 0.905, \"class-0011\": 0.918, \"class-0012\": 0.884, \"class-0013\": 0.926, \"class-0014\": 0.872, \"class-0015\": 0.908}",
              "definition": "per-class precision dumped as JSON"
            }
          ],
          "budget": {
            "steps": 100,
            "gpuHours": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 4,
    "paths": [
      "experiments/legacy/model-v1/metrics.json",
      "experiments/vendor/long-report/metrics.json",
      "experiments/vision/cancelled-run/metrics.json",
      "experiments/vision/weights-only/weights.bin"
    ],
    "admitted": 0,
    "excludedByPredicate": {
      "deleted": [
        "experiments/vision/cancelled-run/metrics.json"
      ],
      "extension": [
        "experiments/vision/weights-only/weights.bin"
      ],
      "user-exclude": [
        "experiments/legacy/model-v1/metrics.json"
      ],
      "default-path": [
        "experiments/vendor/long-report/metrics.json"
      ]
    },
    "sourceExcluded": 0,
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false,
    "bundleKeys": []
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "即使整个候选集被闸门排除，锚点本身仍可重算：被排除的是「是否值得评审」，不是「这句话在不在记录里」。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "experiment-metric",
          "path": "experiments/vendor/long-report/metrics.json",
          "locator": {
            "experimentId": "vendor/long-report",
            "metricName": "per_class_report",
            "startLine": 4
          },
          "excerpt": "metric per_class_report = {\"class-0001\": 0.912, \"class-0002\": 0.881, \"class-0003\": 0.923, \"class-0004\": 0.870, \"class-0005\": 0.901, \"class-0006\": 0.915, \"class-0007\": 0.889, \"class-0008\": 0.933, \"class-0009\": 0.877, \"class-0010\": 0.905, \"class-0011\": 0.918, \"class-0012\": 0.884, \"class-0013\": 0.926, \"class-0014\": 0.872, \"class-0015\": 0.908}"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "experiments/records.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "experiments/vendor/long-report/metrics.json",
              "content": "# experiment vendor/long-report (per class report)\nseed = 4\ndataset = train:1000 valid:100 test:100 splits:sha256:hhh\nmetric per_class_report = {\"class-0001\": 0.912, \"class-0002\": 0.881, \"class-0003\": 0.923, \"class-0004\": 0.870, \"class-0005\": 0.901, \"class-0006\": 0.915, \"class-0007\": 0.889, \"class-0008\": 0.933, \"class-0009\": 0.877, \"class-0010\": 0.905, \"class-0011\": 0.918, \"class-0012\": 0.884, \"class-0013\": 0.926, \"class-0014\": 0.872, \"class-0015\": 0.908}\nmetric per_class_report.definition = per-class precision dumped as JSON\nbaseline = (none)"
